{"productId": "10095dd6-3755-4151-ace9-4557fd334d8d", "modelName": "Model 70 Super Grade Maple", "modelDescription": "Sweeter than maple syrup. And that is pretty sweet. The look of a Model 70 with a AAAA Maple stock, embellished with classic ebony tip, along with a shadowline cheekpiece is hard to resist. Maple may seem retro to some, but this is beyond retro -- is there such thing as a neo retro? It looks better than any Maple-stocked rifle before. Take it to the range and get the surprise of your life. You will be surrounded with admirers. But it is not just a show gun, it shoots very, very well. With its M.O.A. trigger system and solid Pre-64 action it is a tack driver that can take tough hunting in stride. You have wanted one of these for a long time. Put one on your list and make it happen. ", "manufacturerName": "Winchester Repeating Arms", "subProducts": [{"isFirearm": true, "isNfa": false, "subProductId": "0a0f5d35-4824-4c81-b60b-9cbddf77e593", "description": "Winchester Repeating Arms, Model 70 Super Grade Maple, Bolt Action, 300 Win Mag, 26\" Barrel, Blued Finish, Maple Stock, Right Hand, 3 Round Capacity", "imageUrls": ["https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/b7d8996a-0f91-4439-9ea5-7e87add24e0e"], "isDefault": false, "manufacturerPartNumber": "535218233", "upc": "048702006036", "attributes": [{"attributeNameId": "6de54e07-e352-463c-bf38-3079da1974f9", "attributeName": "Factory Equipped Sights", "attributeValueId": "58b272c7-0c5c-40f2-a6f8-b83b1071cc15", "valueName": "None"}, {"attributeNameId": "7c11c5f3-970e-4119-9b86-521429f6df57", "attributeName": "Stock Type", "attributeValueId": "e282f44e-03e0-4ae2-9f93-dd5f73c65562", "valueName": "Wood"}, {"attributeNameId": "dc7a7e89-2701-44c0-a795-288bc55143bb", "attributeName": "Barrel Length", "attributeValueId": "524fd6af-ee59-44e5-8666-9037f52a8b0d", "valueName": "26\""}, {"attributeNameId": "c8cd558c-27d3-4d9a-9936-eb7c87c5ba92", "attributeName": "Color", "attributeValueId": "489958cc-0acf-432b-a